Manage upload destinations

Usage: kropa dest [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list         List destinations
  show         Show a destination (never its secrets)
  add          Add a destination
  edit         Edit a destination
  test         Send a test image to a destination
  remove       Remove a destination and its secrets
  set-default  Choose the default destination
  import       Import a destination from a .sxcu or TOML file
  export       Export destinations as TOML (secret references only)

Options:
      --json             Machine-readable output: one JSON object on stdout
      --lang <LANG>      Language of messages (fr or en)
  -q, --quiet            Fewer messages on stderr (errors are kept)
  -v, --verbose...       More messages on stderr (-vv: debug log)
      --no-input         Never prompt, even on a terminal
      --color <COLOR>    Colour of stderr output: auto (default), always or never
      --config <DIR>     Configuration folder
      --password-fd <N>  Read the vault passphrase on this file descriptor
  -h, --help             Print help
